 "title": "SMAJ series: 400 W surface-mount transient voltage suppressors, SMA (DO-214AC)",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev:2.2",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "A family of glass-passivated transient voltage suppressor diodes in the SMA (DO-214AC) package, each rated to absorb 400 W peak with a 10/1000 µs pulse. Stand-off voltages run from 3.3 V to 440 V, with breakdown voltages held to a 5 % window (A suffix); every voltage comes unidirectional (A) or bidirectional (CA). Its uses are guarding I/O lines, supply buses and other exposed circuits in telecom, computing, industrial and consumer equipment.",
